      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "Hey Igbar - this is expected. The SendCustomEvent-type nodes read the compiled program to figure out the Entry Points, and events are only included in the program if they connect to another flow. I understand that it could be confusing - hopefully examples, documentation and community knowledge ease that issue.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
