  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-07-12T00:29:07.022Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "SDK: 2021.07.08.15.57\nWhen using any version of SendCustomEvent, an event will not appear in the dropdown list unless it actually does something.\nThe attached screenshots make it much clearer:\nThe first screenshot shows that the custom event is not attached to the SetActive node and therefore does nothing. Because of this all of the SendCustomEvent nodes have their dropdowns grayed out.\nIn the second screenshot the event now does something and all of the SendCustomEvent nodes have dropdowns.\nWhile I understand that in most cases this isn't an issue (because why would you have an event node that doesn't do anything?) it could still be potentially confusing.",
